<newsitem itemid="121794" id="root" date="1996-10-16" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Bridport-Gundry pretax profits up in year.</title>
<headline>Bridport-Gundry pretax profits up in year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>				     (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.10		   vs 8.64</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.44		   vs 2.22</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.04		   vs 3.60</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.45		   vs 1.34</p>
<p> Turnover		   30.30		  vs 28.36</p>
<p> Tax			  0.5		    vs 0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Bridport-Gundry Plc said it has agreed to make acquisitions totalling 11.95 million stg, which will be funded via a 3 for 4 rights issue at 130 a share to raise 9.1 million.</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 10</p>
<p> Div registration date  Dec 17</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
